      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The dignity you're grasping for is the dignity of self-determination, and you have that power right now. You can choose to stop fighting the ceiling and instead find the one small, quiet thing that makes the descent bearable, or even beautiful. That choice—to decide how you meet the pressure—is the only real victory left.",
      "source": "target",
